                            <div class="vc_column-inner ">
                                <div class="wpb_wrapper"><h2 style="text-align: left" class="vc_custom_heading h1">
                                        IT<br><strong>Infrastructure</strong></h2>
                                    <div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element  list-adj">
                                        <div class="wpb_wrapper">
                                            
                                            
                                            <p class="selectionShareable">SunFlex has joined the system integration field and provided ICT Solutions
                                                Since 2010. Since then SunFlex has been key partner of world leading ICT
                                                and pioneering and successful enterprise in IT infrastructure solutions
                                                for Banking, MFI, Telecommunication, SMB,…. Currently, SunFlex is one of
                                                the local Leading System integration solutions and Service providers in
                                                Cambodia.</p>
                                            <h6><strong>Innovations that accelerate your digital transformation</strong>:
                                            </h6>
                                            <p class="selectionShareable">Your IT solutions need to work together to create a solid foundation for
                                                your organization. Learn more about how IT infrastructure solutions are
                                                designed to complement each other and to propel your business into the
                                                future</p>
                                            <h6><strong>Get Cloud-Ready</strong></h6>
                                            <p class="selectionShareable">Cloud is the new operating model for IT, and it’s transforming how
                                                business gets done. Now you can get superior results today and plan for
                                                tomorrow with a cloud-ready IT infrastructure that’s available in three
                                                consumption models—on premises, cloud at customer, and public cloud.</p>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
