                                            <h6><strong>Regulatory compliance</strong></h6>
                                            <p class="selectionShareable">The detailed reports generated after penetration testing help to avoid
                                                fines for non-compliance and allow to illustrate due diligence to
                                                auditors by maintaining required security controls.</p>
                                            <h6><strong>Proactive Remediation</strong></h6>
                                            <p class="selectionShareable">SunFlex takes the perspective of the adversary, finding weaknesses and
                                                helping you remediate before the bad guys can do damage.</p>
                                            <h6><strong>Avoiding the cost of system/network downtime</strong></h6>
                                            <p class="selectionShareable">SunFlex team provides specific guidance and recommendations to avoid
                                                financial pitfalls by identifying and addressing risks before attacks or
                                                security breaches occur.</p>
